  - key: aliens.baby_joins.1
    group: aliens.baby_joins
    speaker: 0
    dutch: De baby-alien doet ook mee! Hoeveel aliens dansen er nu?
    english: The baby alien joins in! How many aliens are dancing now?
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 64c9be8e81b91ab4aa6a471216d6f009, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: aliens.one_leaves.1
    group: aliens.one_leaves
    speaker: 0
    dutch: Oei, eentje rent even naar de raket! Hoeveel dansen er nu nog?
    english: Oops, one runs off to the rocket! How many are still dancing?
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d2b5ef4b2f2c0ad4abd1b892410a6034, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: aliens.countdown.1
    group: aliens.countdown
    speaker: 0
    dutch: De raket gaat vertrekken! Tel mee terug. Tik op het getal!
    english: The rocket is about to leave! Count down with me. Tap the number!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c563b44cad454c342a3ef38447002c8a, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: aliens.liftoff.1
    group: aliens.liftoff
    speaker: 0
    dutch: Lancering! Daar gaat de raket!
    english: Lift-off! There goes the rocket!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d5a850f0621a5ec4b800908fc02c0cbd, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: pirates.compare.1
    group: pirates.compare
    speaker: 5
    dutch: Twee stapels goud! Welke stapel is het grootst? Tik erop!
    english: Two piles of gold! Which pile is bigger? Tap it!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 88f9f9876781c7f4a91920eb46f08d77, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: pirates.compare_hint.1
    group: pirates.compare_hint
    speaker: 5
    dutch: Kraa! We tellen ze allebei. Tel maar mee!
    english: Squawk! Let's count them both. Count along!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 22bc45593c277fc4a8bbf4724d4794e2, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: pirates.compare_share.1
    group: pirates.compare_share
    speaker: 5
    dutch: De kleine stapel is voor de skeletten. Kijk eens hoe blij ze zijn!
    english: The small pile is for the skeletons. Look how happy they are!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 80dfb46568338994a915f57e6eb9b64d, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: pirates.hidden.1
    group: pirates.hidden
    speaker: 5
    dutch: Kijk goed! Lorre verstopt een paar munten onder de emmer!
    english: Watch closely! Lorre hides some coins under the bucket!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 96136e415f8ae004ab5f04291157c1d6, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: pirates.hidden_ask.1
