  - key: toys.board_intro.1
    group: toys.board_intro
    speaker: 3
    dutch: Dit is je stickerbord. Speel met alles in de speeltuin, dan krijg je stickers!
    english: This is your sticker board. Play with everything on the playground to
      get stickers!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5c2837551ab743f41bf8c90d521c73d1, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.queen_hello.1
    group: castle.queen_hello
    speaker: 1
    dutch: Hallo, ridder! Ik ben de koningin van het kasteel. Wat fijn dat je er
      bent!
    english: Hello, knight! I'm the queen of the castle. I'm so glad you're here!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7a892a25be0c7754f840ef3049b1ddea, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.mission.cake.1
    group: castle.mission.cake
    speaker: 1
    dutch: Vanavond is er feest, met een grote taart! Maar de kobolden willen de
      taart stelen. Help je ons?
    english: Tonight there's a party with a big cake! But the goblins want to steal
      the cake. Will you help us?
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6a493541a7429fa47a56ce9eec3461c6, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.mission.crown.1
    group: castle.mission.crown
    speaker: 1
    dutch: Mijn gouden kroon ligt klaar voor het feest. Maar de kobolden willen hem
      pakken! Help je ons?
    english: My golden crown is ready for the party. But the goblins want to grab
      it! Will you help us?
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e142e2756798ba947b952e645ed33ef4, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.mission.egg.1
    group: castle.mission.egg
    speaker: 1
    dutch: Kijk, we hebben een groot ei gevonden! De kobolden willen het hebben.
      Pas jij erop?
    english: Look, we found a big egg! The goblins want it. Will you look after it?
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 907171ae0020abb4b885f8ce35a2b9a5, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.mission.knight.1
    group: castle.mission.knight
    speaker: 1
    dutch: Oh nee! Een ridder zit vast boven op de toren! En de kobolden komen eraan.
      Help je ons?
    english: Oh no! A knight is stuck on top of the tower! And the goblins are coming.
      Will you help us?
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fb407802ed5029b4fa5cf812a9b8c5c5, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.tower_help.1
    group: castle.tower_help
    speaker: 1
    dutch: Help! Ik zit vast!
    english: Help! I'm stuck!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2dc9ac11d74c91f4980c13ad324df0ae, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.password.1
    group: castle.password
    speaker: 1
    dutch: "Eerst het wachtwoord! Tik op het plaatje dat begint met\u2026"
    english: "First the password! Tap the picture that starts with\u2026"
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d363d7f5dbc3e37418ff746e17813ce1, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.password_new.1
    group: castle.password_new
    speaker: 1
    dutch: 'Dit is een nieuwe letter! Luister maar:'
    english: 'This is a new letter! Listen:'
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a1836c26995144c4e853aa75b114017e, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.password_right.1
    group: castle.password_right
    speaker: 1
    dutch: Goed zo, dat is het wachtwoord! De poort gaat open!
    english: Well done, that's the password! The gate is opening!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a13a1320a3ceb1943acd6a618055e97a, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.wall.1
    group: castle.wall
    speaker: 1
    dutch: Oh nee, er zit een gat in de muur! Tik op de blokken, dan maken we het
      dicht!
    english: Oh no, there's a hole in the wall! Tap the blocks and we'll close it!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2276ca1800da3d346b64e63a10ba3447, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.wall_peek.1
    group: castle.wall_peek
    speaker: 2
    dutch: Hihi! Ik kom zo naar binnen!
    english: Hehe! I'm coming in!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cddc58429679d384b806b9c64574992a, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.wall_hint.1
    group: castle.wall_hint
    speaker: 0
    dutch: Tik op een blok!
    english: Tap a block!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4b50857a441675d48913b912bf9e9674, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.wall_done.1
    group: castle.wall_done
    speaker: 2
    dutch: "H\xE9! Het gat is dicht!"
    english: Hey! The hole is closed!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f9d025fea37d125489c4a70c4339a4e7, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.count.1
    group: castle.count
    speaker: 1
    dutch: Kijk, daar op de muur! Hoeveel kobolden zie je?
    english: Look, up on the wall! How many goblins do you see?
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 83fbc1296b3679140951f735e6a4b341, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.count_more.1
    group: castle.count_more
    speaker: 2
    dutch: Ik ook! Ik doe ook mee!
    english: Me too! I'm joining in!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9785ac7625bb692478b9b53ba4dce887, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.count_less.1
    group: castle.count_less
    speaker: 2
    dutch: Oei, ik ben bang! Ik ga weg!
    english: Eek, I'm scared! I'm leaving!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: eb042532c4179414192af850c16b5ddc, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.count_now.1
    group: castle.count_now
    speaker: 1
    dutch: Hoeveel kobolden zijn er nu?
    english: How many goblins are there now?
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d7a90e90e9a7f4342ae59678c88d1f77, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.jump_down.1
    group: castle.jump_down
    speaker: 2
    dutch: Hop! Daar komen we!
    english: Hop! Here we come!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d95bafe8d21141f4a97f51caa170bcec, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.shield_goblin.1
    group: castle.shield_goblin
    speaker: 0
    dutch: Die kobold heeft een schild! Wacht tot hij het laat zakken!
    english: That goblin has a shield! Wait until he lowers it!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bdd71b5c0b1cda74fbaf83e48c188b5c, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.dizzy.1
    group: castle.dizzy
    speaker: 2
    dutch: Oei, ik zie sterretjes!
    english: Whoa, I'm seeing stars!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 59d0dca33d9a5c540bdb0254a39b4a12, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.troll.1
    group: castle.troll
    speaker: 2
    dutch: Ik ben de grote trol! Hohoho!
    english: I'm the big troll! Ho ho ho!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9666baac09ef48d42ac73a95656c92c8, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.barrel.1
    group: castle.barrel
    speaker: 2
    dutch: Hihi, ik zit in de ton! Vind je mij?
    english: Hehe, I'm in the barrel! Can you find me?
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 80e87d07ae9bb3a4499413a0fd31463a, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.barrel_out.1
    group: castle.barrel_out
    speaker: 2
    dutch: Gevonden! Hihi!
    english: You found me! Hehe!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 280552c94f4f50a4497e4610f5e1a7b4, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.thief_grab.cake.1
    group: castle.thief_grab.cake
    speaker: 2
    dutch: Hihi! Een stuk taart voor mij!
    english: Hehe! A piece of cake for me!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e5414b533241a8f42a7d749af81e6647, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.thief_grab.crown.1
    group: castle.thief_grab.crown
    speaker: 2
    dutch: Hihi! Nu ben ik de koning!
    english: Hehe! Now I'm the king!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 77ef01dea6c4d104e9353bbbce66dd94, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.thief_grab.egg.1
    group: castle.thief_grab.egg
    speaker: 2
    dutch: Hihi! Dat ei is van mij!
    english: Hehe! That egg is mine!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6ae1ad9118fd82e4d828371afc51e6ba, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.thief_chase.1
    group: castle.thief_chase
    speaker: 1
    dutch: Snel, vang die kobold!
    english: Quick, catch that goblin!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c17e9ed05f497b2459dca5e4e6da5294, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.loot_back.1
    group: castle.loot_back
    speaker: 1
    dutch: Goed zo! Je hebt het teruggepakt!
    english: Well done! You got it back!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 80d877e603e140348bafaf06fe60eeaa, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.help_me.1
    group: castle.help_me
    speaker: 1
    dutch: Help! Help mij!
    english: Help! Help me!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cf79b781494d1d747a7f52c9111b2459, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.help_me.2
    group: castle.help_me
    speaker: 1
    dutch: Help! Ze zitten achter mij aan!
    english: Help! They're chasing me!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7b9841162d7008f4abddb087c7dbd890, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.thanks.1
    group: castle.thanks
    speaker: 1
    dutch: Dankjewel! Jij bent een echte ridder!
    english: Thank you! You're a real knight!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2edb7df3bc684814285a96dc75842bbc, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.rescue.1
    group: castle.rescue
    speaker: 1
    dutch: Nu de ridder op de toren! Loop naar de toren!
    english: Now the knight on the tower! Walk to the tower!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 12c4bf5e6961ef144bd74aced8b7f13e, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.rescue_down.1
    group: castle.rescue_down
    speaker: 1
    dutch: Joepie, ik ben vrij! Dankjewel!
    english: Yippee, I'm free! Thank you!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0bba092e5f62eba4cb46ac34b08f3923, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.dragon_arrives.1
    group: castle.dragon_arrives
    speaker: 1
    dutch: Kijk! Een draak!
    english: Look! A dragon!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bab6b0fe240fe904aad1bac62d46955f, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.dragon_hungry.1
    group: castle.dragon_hungry
    speaker: 1
    dutch: Wacht! Hoor je dat? Zijn buik rommelt! De draak heeft gewoon honger!
    english: Wait! Do you hear that? Its tummy is rumbling! The dragon is just hungry!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0bd302aeb4edbc945a5b7f0951afe565, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.dragon_egg.1
    group: castle.dragon_egg
    speaker: 1
    dutch: Wacht! De draak is verdrietig. Ze zoekt haar ei!
    english: Wait! The dragon is sad. She's looking for her egg!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b149cd5e12a1ac0458768e7618eef18d, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.cookies_want.2.1
    group: castle.cookies_want.2
    speaker: 2
    dutch: Ik wil twee koekjes!
    english: I want two cookies!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d059bbe57f8c4204da1bf5bfc902e62b, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.cookies_want.3.1
    group: castle.cookies_want.3
    speaker: 2
    dutch: Ik wil drie koekjes!
    english: I want three cookies!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 664640177b74b974fa7723287990a406, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.cookies_want.4.1
    group: castle.cookies_want.4
    speaker: 2
    dutch: Ik wil vier koekjes!
    english: I want four cookies!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 847e9bba207befa4f9234c5c3f68ae1d, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.cookies_want.5.1
    group: castle.cookies_want.5
    speaker: 2
    dutch: Ik wil vijf koekjes!
    english: I want five cookies!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a70f7c5797e17214386a3cfc146d5718, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.cookies_want.6.1
    group: castle.cookies_want.6
    speaker: 2
    dutch: Ik wil zes koekjes!
    english: I want six cookies!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 99d90c687819041429bc21b61c7c56af, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.cookies_want.7.1
    group: castle.cookies_want.7
    speaker: 2
    dutch: Ik wil zeven koekjes!
    english: I want seven cookies!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c645216b13ee07d47b565b0e5ebab4f8, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.cookies_want.8.1
    group: castle.cookies_want.8
    speaker: 2
    dutch: Ik wil acht koekjes!
    english: I want eight cookies!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1e3d090ceefb48248bb1a0f156d4c2cc, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.cookies_hint.1
    group: castle.cookies_hint
    speaker: 1
    dutch: Tik op de koekjes. Is het genoeg? Tik dan op de knop!
    english: Tap the cookies. Is it enough? Then tap the button!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 144104b823cad4a48bfe991eb47b868f, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.cookies_more.1
    group: castle.cookies_more
    speaker: 2
    dutch: Nog meer! Ik heb nog honger!
    english: More! I'm still hungry!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 74cd92a6466495a409c6dfec333c8637, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.cookies_too_many.1
    group: castle.cookies_too_many
    speaker: 2
    dutch: Oei, dat zijn er te veel!
    english: Oops, that's too many!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ea38fd0f79bb81f4783cd1ce45d33c51, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.cookies_yum.1
    group: castle.cookies_yum
    speaker: 2
    dutch: Mmm, lekker! Precies genoeg!
    english: Mmm, yummy! Just right!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 06f571d1afd906149a95b0d4d6a19205, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.cookie_big.1
    group: castle.cookie_big
    speaker: 1
    dutch: Geef de draak dit grote koekje! Tik erop!
    english: Give the dragon this big cookie! Tap it!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5475795b06c245c46b642ee501f3943a, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.egg_tap.1
    group: castle.egg_tap
    speaker: 1
    dutch: Tik op het ei, dan brengen we het naar de draak!
    english: Tap the egg and we'll bring it to the dragon!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a9128f73e957c6d40a8202186932f09b, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.egg_hatch.1
    group: castle.egg_hatch
    speaker: 1
    dutch: Kijk! Het ei gaat open!
    english: Look! The egg is hatching!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 926061f2a81f9a94284233eb287bf5e1, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.baby_hello.1
    group: castle.baby_hello
    speaker: 4
    dutch: Piep! Hallo mama!
    english: Peep! Hello mummy!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d4ec60207f97a1646a388f0a3585643b, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.baby_name.1
    group: castle.baby_name
    speaker: 1
    dutch: Het draakje heeft nog geen naam! Kies een letter. Met die klank begint
      zijn naam!
    english: The little dragon has no name yet! Pick a letter. Its name starts with
      that sound!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 144d2feea5d8a2c4eb01b0f8e528db17, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.baby_named.m.1
    group: castle.baby_named.m
    speaker: 1
    dutch: Het draakje heet Mimi!
    english: The little dragon is called Mimi!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1f31f9c5972922f4aa7627af1f379346, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: castle.baby_named.r.1
